---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<Layout
  title="about us"
  description="About Cueory, how its learning content is prepared, and how to support the free study site."
  noindex
>
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-page flex-col gap-8 py-section">
    <header class="mx-auto w-full max-w-hero space-y-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-label text-ink-soft">
        {site.tagline}
      </p>
      <h1 class="display text-display text-ink sm:text-display-lg">about cueory</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-ink">
        {site.description} A free place to explore lessons, review cards, practice questions, an anatomy lab and daily games.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="veil min-w-0 p-6 sm:p-10" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
      <h2 id="mission-heading" class="display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-title">our mission</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink">
        Cueory is meant to make independent study a little clearer. You can study in short sessions and check each lesson's notice to see what is ready and what is still being built.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="veil min-w-0 p-6 sm:p-10" aria-labelledby="lessons-heading">
      <h2 id="lessons-heading" class="display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-title">
        how we make our lessons
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-ink">
        <li>
          <p>Some lessons and activities are samples, drafts or placeholders while the site is being built.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>Some content may not have citations or a licensed-nurse review. Check important information against your current course materials and other trusted sources.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>Use the "Flag or comment" option to report confusing material or possible mistakes. Do not send anyone's private or patient information.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="veil flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-6 p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:p-10" aria-labelledby="coming-heading">
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
        <h2 id="coming-heading" class="display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-title">what's coming</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink">
          More lessons, study tools and daily games are being prepared. Launch-update emails are not open yet. The home page will show when the list is available.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/#signup" class="glass-button inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-center">
        get launch updates
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="veil min-w-0 p-6 sm:p-10" aria-labelledby="support-heading">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <svg
          class="size-14 shrink-0 text-ink-soft"
          viewBox="0 0 48 48"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2.5"
          aria-hidden="true"
          focusable="false"
        >
          <rect x="5" y="11" width="29" height="28" rx="6" />
          <path d="M34 17h4a7 7 0 0 1 0 14h-4" />
          <path d="M20 30c-5-3-8-6-8-9 0-3 4-5 8-1 4-4 8-2 8 1 0 3-3 6-8 9Z" />
        </svg>
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <h2 id="support-heading" class="display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-title">
            help keep cueory free.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink">
            Studying on Cueory is free. You can help by sharing the site or leaving an optional tip through the separate Ko-fi website. Tips do not buy access, influence the material or guarantee results.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/support" class="glass-button inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-center">
          support our mission
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
